{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Explore a citation network"},"description":"Map a field by its citations rather than its keywords: rank papers, authors, journals or institutions in the depth-2 citation graph Inciteful builds around 1\u2013500 seed papers. analysis: similar (shared references and co-citation with the seeds), important (local PageRank), reviews (papers citing many others in the graph), recent (PageRank among papers from the last 3 years), authors, journals, institutions; or references / citations: the seeds' reference lists or citing papers from OpenAlex, sorted by global cited_by_count, with the total count. A graph that is not cached yet can take a minute to build. title_all / title_any / title_none filter by words in paper titles. They match titles only (not abstracts or full text), with Porter stemming. year_from / year_to filter by publication year. Title and year filters apply to the graph analyses, not to references or citations. limit is at most 100. Results carry provenance (method, graph size and depth, the SQL run) and diagnostics.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","properties":{"analysis":{"enum":["similar","important","reviews","recent","authors","journals","institutions","references","citations"],"type":"string"},"limit":{"default":25,"maximum":100,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"seeds":{"description":"1\u2013500 seed papers: DOIs, OpenAlex IDs (W\u2026) or PMIDs. Duplicates count once.","items":{"maxLength":300,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":500,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"title_all":{"description":"Every term must be in the title.","items":{"type":"string"},"maxItems":20,"type":"array"},"title_any":{"description":"At least one term must be in the title.","items":{"type":"string"},"maxItems":20,"type":"array"},"title_none":{"description":"No term may be in the title; needs title_all or title_any.","items":{"